{
  "id": "org-chart",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Create an org chart",
  "lang": "en",
  "app_version": "preprod-2026-10-12",
  "viewport": {
    "width": 1920,
    "height": 1080
  },
  "start": {
    "url": "https://app-pre-production.sloneek.com/app/dashboard-v2",
    "local_storage": {
      "local-translate": "en",
      "teams-management-page": "{\"view\":\"tree\"}"
    }
  },
  "voice": {
    "provider": "external",
    "voice_id": "7jQ3jNk3Fcw65sWUmzun",
    "model_id": "eleven_v4"
  },
  "chapters": true,
  "interstitials": true,
  "thumbnail": {
    "shot": "s19",
    "title": "Org chart"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "narration": "Want every colleague to know right away who their manager is? Hi, I'm Maria from the Sloneek team, and I'll show you how to create an org chart.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_teams",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_teams",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      },
      "part": 1,
      "part_title": "Introduction",
      "hold_after_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "narration": "You'll find the org chart in the left menu, in the Company section, under Teams.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_teams",
          "before_ms": 1200
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_teams",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_teams",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "narration": "I click Teams, and the Teams and organizational structure page opens.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_teams",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=\"teamNode-Customer Support\"]",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] h5:text-is(\"Teams and organizational structure\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=addTeamButton]",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      },
      "part": 2,
      "part_title": "How to read the chart"
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "narration": "Each box is one team: people with a role in the team are at the top, members are below the line, and their positions are in brackets.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "zoom",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Management & Board\"])",
          "value": "1.3",
          "before_ms": 300,
          "hold_ms": 4200
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Management & Board\"]) hr",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "narration": "If you turn off Show users, you'll see just the company's skeleton, meaning which teams belong under which.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=showUsersCheckbox] label",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Management & Board\"]):not(:has(.sloneek-org-chart-user))",
          "value": "8000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=teamsOrgChart]",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Management & Board\"]):not(:has(.sloneek-org-chart-user))",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "narration": "Where a team sits is set by its Parent team field, and a team without one stands on its own, like Customer Support here.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Management & Board\"])",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Customer Support\"])",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Customer Support\"])",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "narration": "I turn users back on and click Add to open the Create a team form.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=showUsersCheckbox] label",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Management & Board\"]) .sloneek-org-chart-user",
          "value": "8000"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=addTeamButton]",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=nameInput]",
          "value": "8000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=creationSidebarHeader]:has-text(\"Create a team\")",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      },
      "part": 3,
      "part_title": "A new team"
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "narration": "In the Name field, I type the name of the new team, Technical Support.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=nameInput]",
          "value": "Technical Support",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=teamDescriptionTextarea]",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "narration": "In the description, I write what the team does, and anyone who clicks on the team can read it.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=teamDescriptionTextarea]",
          "value": "Handles customers' technical questions about the app.",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=parentTeamAutocomplete]",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "narration": "In the Parent team field, I choose Customer Support, so the new team goes under it.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=parentTeamAutocomplete] input",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=autocompleteSearchInput]",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=autocompleteSearchInput]",
          "value": "Customer",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-common-autocomplete-option:has-text(\"Customer Support\")",
          "before_ms": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=parentTeamAutocomplete] [data-cy=autocompleteClearButton]",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "narration": "As the manager, I choose James Miller, who will approve the team's absences.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=teamManagerAutocomplete] input",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=autocompleteSearchInput]",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=autocompleteSearchInput]",
          "value": "James",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-common-autocomplete-option:has-text(\"Miller James\")",
          "before_ms": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "press",
          "value": "Escape",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=teamForm]:has-text(\"Miller James - james.miller@example.com\")",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "narration": "In the Team members field, I add my colleague Olivia Brown.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=teamMembersAutocomplete] input",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=autocompleteSearchInput]",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=autocompleteSearchInput]",
          "value": "Olivia",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-common-autocomplete-option:has-text(\"Brown Olivia\")",
          "before_ms": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "press",
          "value": "Escape",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=teamForm]:has-text(\"Brown Olivia - olivia.brown@example.com\")",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "narration": "Further down are other roles, such as a supervisor who only follows what's going on in the team, or attendance and absence approvers.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=supervisorsAutocomplete]",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "400"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=attendanceApproverAutocomplete]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=absenceApproverAutocomplete]",
          "before_ms": 200
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=absenceApproverAutocomplete]",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "narration": "If a team has no manager, its members' approval requests go to all administrators.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=teamManagerAutocomplete]",
          "before_ms": 500
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=submitButton]",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "narration": "I click Save, and an arrow appears under Customer Support, with the new team tucked beneath it.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=submitButton]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] slnk-common-org-chart-designer:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Customer Support\"]) .children-button button",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Customer Support\"])",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] slnk-common-org-chart-designer:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Customer Support\"]) .children-button button",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "narration": "I expand the branch with the arrow, and Technical Support sits under Customer Support.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] slnk-common-org-chart-designer:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Customer Support\"]) .children-button button",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] slnk-common-org-chart-designer:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Customer Support\"]) [data-cy=\"teamNode-Technical Support\"]",
          "value": "8000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Technical Support\"])",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] slnk-common-org-chart-designer:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Customer Support\"]) [data-cy=\"teamNode-Technical Support\"]",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      },
      "part": 4,
      "part_title": "The team in the chart"
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "narration": "James and Olivia aren't shown yet, because by default the chart only shows active users.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=showEnabledUsersOnlyCheckbox]",
          "before_ms": 600
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Technical Support\"]):not(:has(.sloneek-org-chart-user a))",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "narration": "If you turn off Show only active, you'll also see inactive people with a red dot, such as new hires before their start date.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=showEnabledUsersOnlyCheckbox] label",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Technical Support\"]) [data-cy=\"teamUserNode-Brown Olivia\"]",
          "value": "8000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Technical Support\"])",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Technical Support\"]) [data-cy=\"teamUserNode-Brown Olivia\"]",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "narration": "James has a manager icon next to his name, and Olivia is below the line as a team member, along with her position.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Technical Support\"]) .sloneek-org-chart-user:has(.fa-user-tie)",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Technical Support\"]) .sloneek-org-chart-user:has([data-cy=\"teamUserNode-Brown Olivia\"])",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Technical Support\"]) .sloneek-org-chart-user:has([data-cy=\"teamUserNode-Miller James\"]) .fa-user-tie",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "narration": "The toggle at the top rotates the chart, so the branches spread out from left to right.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=horizontalViewToggle] label",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-self-horizontal",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Technical Support\"])",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-self-horizontal",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      },
      "part": 5,
      "part_title": "Views and export"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "narration": "I switch back to the original view, and with the Show positions checkbox, you can then hide the positions in brackets.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=horizontalViewToggle] label",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-self-vertical",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=showPositionsCheckbox]",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-self-vertical",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "narration": "With the buttons on the right, you collapse or expand the branches, and with Download PNG, you save the chart as an image.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=collapseAllButton]",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=expandAllButton]",
          "before_ms": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #new_dashboard_company_teams_download",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #new_dashboard_company_teams_download",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "narration": "Clicking the team name opens its detail with the description, manager and members.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] slnk-common-org-chart-designer:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Customer Support\"]) [data-cy=\"teamNode-Technical Support\"]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamDetailPanel] [data-cy=teamNameH]:text-is(\"Technical Support\")",
          "value": "8000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamDetailPanel]",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=teamDetailPanel] [data-cy=teamDescriptionAlert]:has-text(\"Handles customers' technical questions about the app.\")",
        "url_contains": "team_id="
      },
      "part": 6,
      "part_title": "Team and people details"
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "narration": "With the pencil button, you can edit the team at any time, and if you change the parent team, the chart rearranges itself.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamDetailPanel] [data-cy=editButton]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=creationSidebarHeader]:has-text(\"Edit team\")",
          "value": "8000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamForm] [data-cy=parentTeamAutocomplete]",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=teamForm]:has-text(\"Brown Olivia - olivia.brown@example.com\")",
        "url_contains": "/company-details/teams/tree"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s25",
      "narration": "I close the form without changes and click on Olivia to see her position and contact details.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=creationSidebarHeader] [data-cy=closeButton]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .sloneek-org-chart-box:has([data-cy=\"teamNode-Technical Support\"]) [data-cy=\"teamUserNode-Brown Olivia\"]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamsUserDetailPanel]:has-text(\"olivia.brown@example.com\")",
          "value": "8000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamsUserDetailPanel]",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=teamsUserDetailPanel]:has-text(\"Customer Support Specialist\")",
        "url_contains": "team_user_id="
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s26",
      "narration": "Through her name, I go to the user profile, where the Position field sets what appears in brackets in the chart.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamsUserDetailPanel] #company_teams_detail_navigate_to_user_profile",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=positionSelect]:has-text(\"Customer Support Specialist\")",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=positionSelect]",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=positionSelect]:has-text(\"Customer Support Specialist\")",
        "url_contains": "/member/3400dd35-a346-41ab-b593-2c55448a631f/work-data"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s27",
      "narration": "The Team field shows where Olivia belongs, and each user can be a member of only one team but can have roles in several teams.",
      "actions": [
